--- Sound effects : sounds/*.ogg ---
Imported from a personal collection of short sound samples with
tools/import_sounds.sh . Their origin and licensing were not verified .
Before redistributing this repository publicly , replace them with clips of
known provenance ( for example freesound.org samples under CC0 ) or remove
the sounds/ directory ; the application runs fine without any sounds .
